docs {
  ### Submit Proposal
  Submits a proposal to a job. The calling user is set as the applicant.
  
  > [!IMPORTANT]
  > Users cannot submit a proposal to their own job. Each applicant can only submit one proposal per job.
  
  #### Headers
  - `Authorization: Bearer <token>` (Inherited)
  
  #### Response (201 Created)
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "id": "uuid-string",
      "status": "active",
      "job": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
      "applicant": "uuid-string",
      "description": "I can fix your container...",
      "attachments": [...],
      "created_at": "2026-06-24T00:30:00.000Z",
      "updated_at": "2026-06-24T00:30:00.000Z"
    },
    "message": "Job proposal submitted successfully"
  }
  ```
}
